@startuml
title 一次订单执行的正交状态轴（2026-11）
skinparam shadowing false

state "订单生命周期\nOrderLifecycleState" as OrderLifecycle {
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending --> Executing : BeginOrderExecution\nMarkExecuting
    Executing --> Succeeded : Deliver success\nMarkSucceeded
    Executing --> Failed : Fail / Cancel\nMarkFailed
    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
  }

state "过程生命周期\nProcessState" as ProcessLifecycle {
    [*] --> Created
    Created --> Ready : Begin / MarkReady
    Ready --> Running : Start
    Running --> Blocked : guard blocks
    Blocked --> Running : guard recovers
    Running --> Succeeded : OnFinished success
    Running --> Failed : guard/deadline failure
    Blocked --> Failed : grace expired
    Running --> Aborted : Cancel
    Blocked --> Aborted : Cancel
    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Aborted --> [*]
  }

state "会话阶段\nOrderExecutionStage" as SessionStages {
    [*] --> MasterPath
    MasterPath --> MasterPath : next plan step
    MasterPath --> MasterGreedy : path exhausted but unsatisfied
    MasterPath --> Transfer : B-type preprocessed
    MasterPath --> Done : A-type satisfied
    MasterGreedy --> Transfer : B-type
    MasterGreedy --> Done : success / failure
    Transfer --> SlavePath : transfer accepted
    Transfer --> Done : transfer failed
    SlavePath --> SlavePath : next plan step
    SlavePath --> SlaveGreedy : path failed
    SlavePath --> Done : success / failure
    SlaveGreedy --> Done
  }

state "罐子操作锁\nJar.IsMarked" as JarMarks {
    [*] --> AllFree : Begin / ClearMarks
    AllFree --> SomeMarked : first jar operation / MATCH
    SomeMarked --> SomeMarked : other jar operation
    SomeMarked --> AllFree : next phase / deliver / fail
  }

state "从台位置职责\nTemporarySlavePosition" as SlavePosition {
  [*] --> IdleEmpty
  IdleEmpty --> ReservedForB : SetSlaveIndex\n仅接受空工作台
  ReservedForB --> RaisedWithOrderResources : B 类选择性转移
  RaisedWithOrderResources --> DrainingToMaster : 成功 / 失败 / 取消
  DrainingToMaster --> IdleEmpty : 从台当前剩余物全集已处理
  ReservedForB --> IdleEmpty : 取消选择
}

note right of OrderLifecycle
  订单状态只有一个权威源：`Order.Lifecycle`。
  `Order.Status` 只是映射为“待执行 / 执行中 / 成功 / 失败”的 JSON 投影。
  `OrderEvent.Status` 也只读取该投影，不再保存第二份字符串。
end note

note bottom of ProcessLifecycle
  过程状态描述“这次工作是否还活着”；
  它不能替代订单状态。订单状态描述“委托本身是否已消费”。
end note

note bottom of JarMarks
  `IsMarked` 是**单次执行阶段的排他锁**，
  不是“罐子曾经被操作过”的永久历史，也不是罐子生命周期的唯一维度。
end note

note bottom of SlavePosition
  从台只在 B 类订单期间持有资源，终态必须回到 IdleEmpty。
  无 B 类过程而仍持有资源 ⇒ SLAVE-RESIDUAL-WITHOUT-B-ORDER。
  活动订单过程存续期间，主台/从台位置冻结。
end note

note bottom of SessionStages
  MATCH 不是会话阶段或 tick 单位，只是交付预留与可行性匹配。
  只有真正改变资源的操作（POUR_IN / POUR_OUT / RESHAPE / TRANSFER）才推进阶段。
  B 类全部目标迁移是一个 TRANSFER 单位，完成后可立即原子交付。
end note
@enduml
